{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"二十有三年春，公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"祭叔來聘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"夏，公如齊觀社。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"荊人來聘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"公及齊侯遇于穀。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"蕭叔朝公。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"秋，丹桓宮楹。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"冬十有一月，曹伯射姑卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"十有二月甲寅，公會齊侯盟于扈。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"二十三年夏，公如齊觀社，非禮也。曹劌諫曰：「不可。夫禮，所以整民也。故會以訓上下之則，制財用之節；朝以正班爵之義，帥長幼之序；征伐以討其不然。諸侯有王，王有巡守，以大習之。非是，君不舉矣。君舉必書，書而不法，後嗣何觀？」","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"晉桓、莊之族偪，獻公患之。士蒍曰：「去富子，則羣公子可謀也已。」公曰：「爾試其事。」士蒍與羣公子謀，譖富子而去之。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_52_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_52","textTraditional":"秋，丹桓宮之楹。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}